headers {
  Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
  SOAPAction: ""
}

docs {
  Product Catalog SOAP service (JAX-WS) - every operation, with tests.

  Run in order with the Collection Runner (or `bru run --env local`).
  The CRUD folder chains requests: Create stores {{productId}} and {{sku}} for the next steps.
  List & Search assume demo data (SEED_DATA=true) but only assert rules, not exact rows.
  SOAP faults are HTTP 500; tests check the typed <code> in the CatalogFault detail.
}
